h":"虛擬路由和轉發(VRF)用於將單個路由器分為:","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"MULTIPLE VIRTUAL ROUTERS","zh":"多個虛擬 路由器","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"•\n虛擬路由和轉發(VRF)用於將單個路由器分為:\n多個虛擬 路由器","kind":"prose"},{"en":"o \nSimilar to how VLANs are used to divide a SINGLE SWITCH (LAN) into MULTIPLE \nVIRTUAL SWITCHES (VLANs) \n• \nIt does this by allowing a ROUTER to build MULTIPLE SEPARATE ROUTING TABLES","source":"text","id":"p379-b23","segments":[{"en":"o","zh":"零 級","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"Similar to how VLANs are used to divide a SINGLE SWITCH (LAN) into MULTIPLE VIRTUAL SWITCHES (VLANs)","zh":"類似於VLANs如何將單 交換器 (LAN) 分割成多個虛擬 交換器 (VLAN)","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"It does this by allowing a ROUTER to build MULTIPLE SEPARATE ROUTING TABLES","zh":"它這樣做的方式是允許路由器建立多個獨立的路由表.","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"零 級\n類似於VLANs如何將單 交換器 (LAN) 分割成多個虛擬 交換器 (VLAN)\n•\n它這樣做的方式是允許路由器建立多個獨立的路由表.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"o \nINTERFACES (LAYER 3 only) and ROUTERS are configured to be in a specific VRF \n(aka VRF INSTANCE) \no \nROUTER INTERFACES, SVIs and ROUTED PORTS on MULTILAYER SWITCHES can \nbe configured in a VRF \n• \nTRAFFIC in one VRF cannot be forwarded out of an INTERFACE in another VRF","source":"text","id":"p379-b24","segments":[{"en":"o","zh":"零 級","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"INTERFACES (LAYER 3 only) and ROUTERS are configured to be in a specific VRF (aka VRF INSTANCE)","zh":"介面(僅包括層 3)和路由器的配置為特定VRF(aka VRF例項)","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"o","zh":"零 級","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"ROUTER INTERFACES, SVIs and ROUTED PORTS on MULTILAYER SWITCHES can be configured in a VRF","zh":"路由器介面,多層上 SVI和路由埠交換器可以配置在一個VRF中.","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"TRAFFIC in one VRF cannot be forwarded out of an INTERFACE in another VRF","zh":"一個VRF不能從另一個VRF的介面中轉出。","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"零 級\n介面(僅包括層 3)和路由器的配置為特定VRF(aka VRF例項)\n零 級\n路由器介面,多層上 SVI和路由埠交換器可以配置在一個VRF中.\n•\n一個VRF不能從另一個VRF的介面中轉出。","kind":"prose"},{"en":"o \nAs an exception, VRF LEAKING can be configured to allow traffic to pass BETWEEN \nVRFs \n• \nVRF is commonly used to facilitate MPLS (Multiple Protocol Label Switching)","source":"text","id":"p379-b25","segments":[{"en":"o","zh":"零 級","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"As an exception, VRF LEAKING can be configured to allow traffic to pass BETWEEN VRFs","zh":"作為例外,可以配置出VRF出漏,允許流量在VRFs之間透過.","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"VRF is commonly used to facilitate MPLS (Multiple Protocol Label Switching)","zh":"VRF通常用於便利MPLS(多議定書標籤交換)","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"零 級\n作為例外,可以配置出VRF出漏,允許流量在VRFs之間透過.\n•\nVRF通常用於便利MPLS(多議定書標籤交換)","kind":"prose"},{"en":"o \nThe kind of VRF we are talking about is VRF-Lite (VRF without MPLS) \n• \nVRF is commonly used by SERVICE PROVIDERS to allow ONE DEVICE to carry traffic from \nMULTIPLE CUSTOMERS","source":"text","id":"p379-b26","segments":[{"en":"o","zh":"零 級","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"The kind of VRF we are talking about is VRF-Lite (VRF without MPLS)","zh":"我們所說的那種VRF是vrf-Lite(VRF沒有MPLS).","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"VRF is commonly used by SERVICE PROVIDERS to allow ONE DEVICE to carry traffic from","zh":"VRF是服務供應商通常使用的一種手段,允許一種裝置從","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"MULTIPLE CUSTOMERS","zh":"多個客戶","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"零 級\n我們所說的那種VRF是vrf-Lite(VRF沒有MPLS).\n•\nVRF是服務供應商通常使用的一種手段,允許一種裝置從\n多個客戶","kind":"prose"},{"en":"o \nEach CUSTOMER’S TRAFFIC is isolated from the OUTSIDE \no \nCUSTOMER IP ADDRESSES can overlap without issue \nVRF CONFIGURATION","source":"text","id":"p379-b27","segments":[{"en":"o","zh":"零 級","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"Each CUSTOMER’S TRAFFIC is isolated from the OUTSIDE","zh":"每個客戶的交通都從外面隔離","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"o","zh":"零 級","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"CUSTOMER IP ADDRESSES can overlap without issue","zh":"客戶IP addresses可以不發